WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.079 --> 00:00:13.900
8, 7, 6, 5, 4, 3, 2, 1

00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:41.350
We're going to need everyone to [inaudible]

00:00:41.350 --> 00:00:49.549
Keep going ...

00:00:49.549 --> 00:01:09.110
This is the "hand of God"

00:01:09.110 --> 00:01:27.810
[cheering]

00:01:27.810 --> 00:02:05.229
[marbles falling]

00:02:05.229 --> 00:02:11.340
It triggered!

00:02:11.340 --> 00:02:29.670
[inaudible, children talking]

00:02:29.670 --> 00:02:47.400
Their brick just shut off!

00:02:47.400 --> 00:02:57.900
Alright!

00:02:57.900 --> 00:03:08.390
Pull!

00:03:08.390 --> 00:03:18.880
[rattling]

00:03:18.880 --> 00:03:29.380
[laughing]

00:03:29.380 --> 00:03:39.870
[cheering]

00:03:39.870 --> 00:04:11.360
Is that working?

00:04:11.360 --> 00:04:32.229
It's over here too!

00:04:32.229 --> 00:05:11.469
It's already over there.

00:05:11.469 --> 00:05:21.279
[inaudible]

00:05:21.279 --> 00:05:44.080
This one fell.

00:05:44.080 --> 00:06:09.819
Oh, nice.

00:06:09.819 --> 00:06:22.689
[feedback]

00:06:22.689 --> 00:06:26.020
Another hand of God, it's working perfectly!

00:06:26.020 --> 00:06:51.690
[sound of crank]

00:06:51.690 --> 00:07:14.929
Ooh!

00:07:14.929 --> 00:07:38.169
[crowd]

00:07:38.169 --> 00:08:24.649
[dominoes falling]

00:08:24.649 --> 00:09:11.130
[crowd cheering]

00:09:11.130 --> 00:09:34.370
Yay!

00:09:34.370 --> 00:09:57.610
[crowd]

